---
// QR image comes from `npm run brand` (scripts/brand-assets.mjs); rerun it with the live domain.
---

<section id="qr" class="mx-auto hidden max-w-6xl scroll-mt-6 px-4 pb-20 sm:px-6 md:block">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-10 rounded-[2rem] bg-yellow px-10 py-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:px-14">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl leading-tight font-bold text-balance lg:text-5xl">Bawa resepnya ke dapur.</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-lg text-navy/85">
        Pindai dengan kamera HP. Resep terbuka di layar kecil, bahan bisa dicentang satu per satu sambil memasak.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="brand-panel ml-1.5 p-4">
      <img src="/qr-skippy-dapur.svg" alt="Kode QR menuju halaman resep SKIPPY® Dapur" width="200" height="200" class="size-48 lg:size-52" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
